## Acceptable Use

This project implements wireless deauthentication, PMKID/handshake capture,
and (in later phases) rogue-AP and credential-harvesting techniques. These are
active attacks against wireless infrastructure and, in most jurisdictions,
illegal to run against networks or devices you do not own or do not hold
explicit written authorization to test.

By using this software you agree to run it only against:

- Networks and devices you personally own, or
- Networks and devices you hold explicit written authorization to test
  (e.g. an authorized penetration test or security research engagement).

This license grants no authorization to test any network. Obtaining and
keeping evidence of that authorization is your responsibility, not this
project's. The authors accept no liability for misuse.
